// 真Common顺序核原训练/行军/休整链入口，不借后来疲劳；完整来源领域的其他资格另由原总验保证。
#include "resident/domains/military/military_combat_conditions_source.hpp"
#include <iostream>
#include <stdexcept>
using namespace hanmo::resident;
namespace {int checks=0;void check(bool x,const char* why){++checks;if(!x)throw std::runtime_error(why);}void good(Status s){if(!s.ok)throw std::runtime_error(s.error.original.code);}template<class T>T take(Outcome<T> r){if(!r.ok)throw std::runtime_error(r.error.original.code);return std::move(r.value);}}
int main(){try{
 auto common_catalog=std::make_shared<CommonCatalog>();CommonState seed;seed.next_instance_id=10;seed.identity.tick=8;CommonStore common(seed,common_catalog);
 MilitaryCatalog cat;cat.garrison_rest_policy=MilitaryGarrisonRestPolicy{};cat.combat_condition_policy=MilitaryCombatConditionRule{};GarrisonDefinition camp;camp.id="camp";MilitaryUnitDefinition def;def.id="unit";def.initial_training=30;def.initial_fatigue=80;camp.units={def};cat.garrisons={camp};MilitaryState s;MilitaryUnitRecord unit;unit.id="unit";unit.source_garrison_id="camp";unit.training=30;unit.fatigue=63;s.military_units={unit};
 MilitaryGarrisonRestFact rest;rest.id="military_rest:1";rest.tick=2;rest.unit_id="unit";rest.training=30;rest.fatigue_before=80;rest.fatigue_after=70;s.garrison_rest.facts={rest};good(common.append_fact({rest.id,"military_garrison_rest","military"}));MilitaryMarchFact march;march.id="military:2";march.tick=5;march.units={{"unit",30,70,73,{}}};s.march_facts={march};good(common.append_fact({march.id,"military_march","military"}));MilitaryRoutEntryFact entry;entry.id="military_rout_entry:3";entry.tick=5;entry.initial.id="battle:4";entry.initial.created_tick=5;BattleUnit u;u.unit_id="unit";entry.initial.units={u};s.rout.entries={entry};good(common.append_fact({entry.id,"military_rout_entry","military"}));rest.id="military_rest:5";rest.tick=8;rest.fatigue_before=73;rest.fatigue_after=63;s.garrison_rest.facts.push_back(rest);good(common.append_fact({rest.id,"military_garrison_rest","military"}));
 auto before=take(query_military_condition_before_rout_entry(common,s,cat,"unit",entry.id));check(before.condition.fatigue==73&&before.last_source_id=="military:2","exact entry includes actual same tick march and excludes later rest");check(take(fold_military_condition(s,cat,"unit",8)).fatigue==63,"today condition remains separately true");MilitaryCombatConditionState frozen;frozen.entry_tick=5;frozen.units={{"unit","camp","military:2",Integer(30),Integer(73),7500,{}}};good(validate_military_combat_condition_entry(common,s,cat,entry,frozen));auto wrong=frozen;wrong.units[0].fatigue=63;wrong.units[0].efficiency_bp=9000;check(!validate_military_combat_condition_entry(common,s,cat,entry,wrong).ok,"later favorable current fatigue cannot replace entry");wrong=frozen;wrong.units[0].last_condition_fact_id="military_rest:5";check(!validate_military_combat_condition_entry(common,s,cat,entry,wrong).ok,"later actual source cannot support past entry");
 const auto stable=common;common.state().identity.tick=4;check(!query_military_condition_before_rout_entry(common,s,cat,"unit",entry.id).ok,"stable rejects actual preclock to");DynamicStepInput phase{4,5,{},{},{}};check(take(query_military_condition_before_rout_entry(common,s,cat,"unit",entry.id,&phase)).condition.fatigue==73,"strict original phase accepts its real entry");phase.to_tick=6;check(!query_military_condition_before_rout_entry(common,s,cat,"unit",entry.id,&phase).ok,"arbitrary future phase rejected");common=stable;
 common.state().facts.erase("military:2");good(common.append_fact({"military:2","military_march","military"}));check(!query_military_condition_before_rout_entry(common,s,cat,"unit",entry.id).ok,"numeric ID alone cannot override actual Common sequence");common=stable;common.state().facts.find("military:2")->kind="military_supply";check(!query_military_condition_before_rout_entry(common,s,cat,"unit",entry.id).ok,"wrong actual source kind rejected");common=stable;s.march_facts[0].units[0].fatigue_before=71;check(!query_military_condition_before_rout_entry(common,s,cat,"unit",entry.id).ok,"broken before value chain rejected");s.march_facts[0].units[0].fatigue_before=70;s.military_units[0].fatigue=0;check(take(query_military_condition_before_rout_entry(common,s,cat,"unit",entry.id)).condition.fatigue==73,"pure historical reader never uses today value");
 std::cout<<"MILITARY_COMBAT_CONDITION_SOURCE="<<checks<<" FAILURES=0 SCOPE=EXACT_ENTRY_SOURCE_COMPONENT\n";return 0;
 }catch(const std::exception& e){std::cerr<<"MILITARY_COMBAT_CONDITION_SOURCE_FAIL "<<checks<<" "<<e.what()<<'\n';return 1;}}
